WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680
In this video, you delete a workspace that is no longer needed. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:12.527
Open the workspace list. In the facility sidebar, select Settings, then Workspaces.

2.1
00:00:12.527 --> 00:00:18.909
Step 2. Open the workspace. Select the workspace name, or Edit in its row.

2.2
00:00:18.909 --> 00:00:22.309
Care opens the Edit workspace page.

3.1
00:00:22.309 --> 00:00:28.166
Step 3. Select Delete workspace. It is at the bottom of the Edit workspace page.

3.2
00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:34.413
If you only want to stop offering the workspace on encounters, archive it instead.

4.1
00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:40.721
Step 4. Confirm the delete. In the Delete workspace dialog, select Delete.

4.2
00:00:40.721 --> 00:00:46.134
You cannot undo a delete. Care then shows Workspace deleted.
